            "description": {
              "value": "The stars and moon lend you their light. You gain your choice of the moonbeam or zenith star (Lost Omens Gods & Magic 117) domain spell. Like your Oatia skysage spells, you cast this focus spell as an occult spell. It costs 1 Focus Point to cast a focus spell. This feat grants a focus pool of 1 Focus Point that you can recover by using the Refocus to reflect upon or gaze at the stars."
